commit 4e1cc74458912236c5bd73728fb9de117a9cac00

C03: a compound relative request without amounts asks for both adjustments (AUDIO1463)

AUDIO1461 measured that «subí el volumen y bajá el brillo» asked both amounts with both directions, but its two variants asked only about the volume: the clarification intent carried only audio.volume.adjust, and the brightness survived only when the model repeated it.

baxy_mind effect_intent: when the relative volume request without an amount also carries a relative brightness request without an amount, the clarification intent lists both adjustments (audio.volume.adjust and system.settings.adjust) with the missing amount.
baxy_mind llm: for that compound intent the formulated question must name the volume and the brightness; a question that drops one gets one corrected retry (the correction states the two adjustments and their directions) and then fails the contract instead of publishing half the question.

Offline probes: the literal and the two new variants («Aumentá el volumen y reducí el brillo.», «Subí el volumen y bajá el brillo de la pantalla.») resolve to the two-operation amount clarification; «subí el volumen», «bajá el brillo» and «bajá la música» keep their single-operation clarifications; a compound with a number keeps its reading. Mind only (BUILD1463). Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


